  "instructions": [
    "Heat 1 tablespoon of vegetable oil in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and garlic and cook until softened, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the tomatoes and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Add the soy sauce, sugar, tomato paste, and sake, and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the vegetable broth and bring the mixture to a simmer.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and cook for 5-7 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Cook the udon noodles according to the package instructions and drain.",
    "In a large serving bowl, combine the cooked noodles and tomato sauce.",
    "Sprinkle with green onions, sesame seeds, and shichimi togarashi.",
    "Season with salt and ground black pepper to taste.",
    "Serve immediately, garnished with toasted sesame oil and scallions, if desired."
  ],
